  "body": "## Changelog\n* 871fa5ce9cac665d6cd4133b4bbc96bbed078be2 Add HTTPS as a default RR type\n* 2b19fb78beb9d0c90d239330b50eed05f94c9fd7 Merge pull request #144 from racpast/fix/cli-arg-parsing\n* 9e273f6e920b85d69a3841bc80dbe280d2081b57 Merge pull request #145 from racpast/fix/idna-underscore\n* 871b8e096eefd889452aaa4b26b9ae63be1108e5 Merge pull request #149 from ryankoski/rk/update_default_rr\n* 22a471fdd4a35d4c0148c44eea27c1f8ec9deb56 Merge pull request #155 from racpast/fix/quic-nil-pointer\n* 68016efaa702a74d7c6215b56b005007dedacf07 Merge pull request #156 from racpast/feat/mdns-support\n* d57b6cd2730fb1b2dde58eec7d62255e7f0fe59d Merge pull request #157 from racpast/feat/config-file\n* f7b2ad256a5080d87f3d0ceae5203981139b5112 chore: bump deps\n* b26047b2cd3a8cb517f528efe48ba64d162d2dac feat: add mDNS support by relaxing source IP verification\n* 7de9545e4918eb8cf5eba027fcb623141a2445f3 feat: add support for loading options from ~/.qrc\n* a4e28012ebc6d50e2c3f584d07ed85d9f4e2643b fix: duplicate sections\n* 26256632f4c366c10ba88211e552f3ca6d9816f4 fix: ede test\n* 77c0df2ca8a01e4c017e858ae42b553cea786cbb fix: panic on empty argument in SetFalseBooleans\n* 560e15fe3c5fb2777ee3473627d7ec39ac684527 fix: prevent panic on nil QUIC connection close\n* fb25e845c48667bdbe87c91a7f2123965606d387 fix: resolve issue with combining short flags and equal signs\n* 628e9a3746161e2f47df6b6dfcc3784122f9e499 fix: tests\n* 01e44c9badc4fbc2eb2996a942403a78cdcd9143 fix: use lax IDNA profile to support underscores in domains\n\n",
